{{if eq .Status "quarantined" -}}
Content screening withheld a file on your Wardlock server. It is no longer
served on any site or address; the rest of each site keeps working.
{{- else -}}
Content screening flagged a file on your Wardlock server for your review.
It is still served.
{{- end}}

File:       sha256 {{.SHA256}}
Categories: {{range $i, $c := .Categories}}{{if $i}}, {{end}}{{$c}}{{end}}
Checked:    {{.CheckedAt.UTC.Format "2006-01-02 15:04 UTC"}}
{{if .Uses}}
Served by:
{{- range .Uses}}
    {{.Site}}  /{{.Path}}  (owner {{.Owner}})
{{- end}}
{{else}}
No site serves it at the moment.
{{end}}
{{- if .Minors}}
The endpoint flagged it as sexual content involving minors. Do not open,
copy or forward it. Preserve it and report it as "Preserving and reporting
illegal material" in docs/DEPLOYMENT.md describes: take down the sites,
suspend their owners, keep the file held with

    wardlockd admin moderation confirm {{.SHA256}}

and report it to the authorities.
{{else}}
Review it, then run one of:

    wardlockd admin moderation release {{.SHA256}}   (serve it again)
    wardlockd admin moderation confirm {{.SHA256}}   (keep it withheld and held)
    wardlockd admin moderation discard {{.SHA256}}   (keep it withheld; let garbage collection remove it)

See "Content screening" in docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
{{end -}}
